But player yaw=PI means forward (sin PI=0, cos PI=-1) = -z. Camera positioned behind +z, looking -z at bot at z0 from z8. Good. Bot chest y+0.62, camera at y? Player pos y = bot ground, camera around y+1.4, looking slightly down? pitch 0, look at target + fwd*14 at same y ~ ground+0.9, so ray might pass above bot chest? Camera y ~ ground+1.4, look at ground+0.9 at 14 units => slightly down. At 8 units, y maybe 1.1, chest 0.62. Could miss. Set pitch=-0.06? Actually pitch positive looks up in this code? fwd.y = sin(pitch). For looking down, pitch negative. Set p.pitch=-0.08. Camera target is pos+0.9. Camera look target = target + fwd*14 where target y=pos+0.9, fwd.y=-0.08 => y=pos+0.9-1.12=pos-0.22, so at 8m ray from cam y pos+1.4 down to pos-0.22 crosses chest around. Good.

Need bot not shoot player. Set b.fireTimer=999. Also b.speed=0, b.target=null, b.targetTimer=999.

Call playerShoot 5 times; hit detection uses raySphere; check hp drop. Pio Glock damage maybe 15? Let's inspect. We'll see.

Also test pickup: find nearby weapon pickup, teleport player, call takePickup. But after combat test, okay.

